+4. aop/iop-aop-nub `segment-ranges` under the 25G83 stub iBoot, and that the AOP is halted at handoff (the J604 27.2 runtime ADT, booted by the macOS iBoot, has the five segments __TEXT/__DATA/__ETEXT/__EDATA/__OS_LOG and the same DAPF bank). The code refuses and disables the AOP on either mismatch.
 5. The boot CPU, and the PMGR CPU_START status before and after secondary start (logged by m1n1 around each CPU start).
 6. The kernel DT compatible for J604 (`apple,j604`) and its PCIe port description (kernel device tree).
 
